{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the discovery of the tablet of the Old Masters, the world has been caught in the winds of change, and the future is full of uncertainty. As a wandering artist, your journey leads you to a mystical valley. Will you find inspiration for your art there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valley of the Old Masters</strong> is an old-school action-adventure game. It features a cryptic world full of secrets to uncover, a mysterious backstory, and many challenges and puzzles to solve.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a mysterious valley.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ancient sketches and paintings. Be inspired by them and draw your own sketches to fill your sketchbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other wanderers who are just as lost as you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dungeons filled with mysterious and cryptic puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of the Old Masters. Who were they, and why did they disappear?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2266870?t=1756992627","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756992627","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266870/96f760d43232fb30a7773dc3ab3bbd51590e3943/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756992627","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266870/96f760d43232fb30a7773dc3ab3bbd51590e3943/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756992627","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the discovery o